    [
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "专题 6 线性时不变系统的判断与应用"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                310,
                109,
                682,
                128
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "考点1: 简易表达式形式下LTIS的判断"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                138,
                549,
                157
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1、系统作用：根据给定的输入输出表达式，白话总结"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                167,
                613,
                184
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、线性系统：先线性后系统  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H[a_{1}e_{1}(t)+a_{2}e_{2}(t)]="
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 先系统后线性  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "a_{1}r_{1}(t)+a_{2}r_{2}(t)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                181,
                192,
                811,
                233
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3、时不变系统：先时移后系统  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "H[e(t-t_{0})]="
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 先系统后时移  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t-t_{0})"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                239,
                719,
                256
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "4、综上所述，给出系统判定结果"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                263,
                453,
                280
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "考点 2: 微分方程形式下 LTIS 的判断"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                305,
                527,
                323
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1、判断方法—反证法"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                333,
                363,
                350
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "table",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/f0076e0b24ce43abb6e03f72ad25a3104aa4a07162acfc9d9b9e728b521caab2.jpg"
                },
                "table_caption": [],
                "table_footnote": [],
                "html": "<table><tr><td>(1)假设为线性系统,即 $[a_1e_1(t)+a_2e_2(t)] \\stackrel{H}{\\leftrightarrow} [a_1r_1(t)+a_2r_2(t)]$ 成立,即将两者带入关系式中所有激励与响应表达式所在处;(2)真实存在的关系:将关系式等号两边同时进行齐次性后再相加;(3)(1)和(2)若相等,则假设成立,即该系统为线性系统,否则为非线性系统。</td></tr><tr><td>(4)假设为时不变系统,即 $e(t-t_0) \\stackrel{H}{\\leftrightarrow} r(t-t_0)$ 成立,即将两者带入关系式中所有激励与响应表达式所在处;(5)真实存在的关系:将关系式等号两边所有的t变成 $t-t_0$ ;(6)(4)和(5)若相等,则假设成立,即该系统为时不变系统,否则为时变系统。</td></tr></table>",
                "table_type": "simple_table",
                "table_nest_level": 1
            },
            "bbox": [
                173,
                353,
                850,
                572
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例 34: 已知系统的输入  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "x(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 和输出  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 之间的关系为"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                586,
                601,
                603
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\frac {d y (t)}{d t} + a y ^ {2} (t) = b x (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/efa09f8d2a2867b3f1dafd292878c0db19b6b119389dab580c7ca7acee48aa8a.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                403,
                610,
