        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "2、LTIS的时不变性质"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                109,
                361,
                124
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "对于时不变系统而言，当系统外加激励发生移位变化时，其对应的(零状态)响应发生相同移位变化。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                133,
                810,
                174
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例如："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                182,
                236,
                198
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "f (t) \\stackrel {H} {\\to} y (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/036a74655e21baf108840149c8d2cea1fec02e4672a5ac92929fa6a86ca3eddc.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                450,
                205,
                544,
                230
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "则"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                235,
                208,
                251
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "f (t - 2) \\stackrel {H} {\\rightarrow}?",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ab3c9ad37ac44b2529bf7e8e502c6705e9ddb8de955316aa2fc6eff57535e484.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                440,
                258,
                546,
                282
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "故答案应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "y(t - 2)"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                289,
                344,
                305
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "2 f _ {1} (t) + 3 f _ {2} (t - 2) \\xrightarrow {H} 2 y _ {1} (t) + 3 y _ {2} (t - 2)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/b91a9ea444d263bc650ea4637bedb8ad7e4d2d85bf8b451d0dc12b768900b421.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                329,
                312,
                663,
                337
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "3、LTIS的微积分性质"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                365,
                363,
                380
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "对于LTI系统满足如下的微分特性:若系统在激励  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 作用下产生响应  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则当激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{de(t)}{dt}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 时，响应为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{dr(t)}{dt}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。根据线性与时不变性容易证明此结论。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                389,
                808,
                438
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "首先由时不变特性可知，激励  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 对应输出  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，则激励  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "e(t-\\Delta t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 产生响应  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "r(t-\\Delta t)"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 。再由叠加性与均匀性可知，若激励为  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{e(t)-e(t-\\Delta t)}{\\Delta t}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 则响应等于  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\frac{r(t)-r(t-\\Delta t)}{\\Delta t}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " ，取  "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "t\\to0"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": " 的极限，得到导数关系。若激励为"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                183,
                444,
                810,
                515
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\lim _ {\\Delta t \\rightarrow 0} \\frac {e (t) - e (t - \\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {d}{d t} e (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/97c1ff33cbc1a07f0041d46c86d94850e783b157202ef1cb6577e07e1d0ff2de.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                376,
                522,
                616,
                555
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "则响应为"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                560,
                262,
                574
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\lim _ {\\Delta t \\to 0} \\frac {r (t) - r (t - \\Delta t)}{\\Delta t} = \\frac {d}{d t} r (t)",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0452ab42bd6d3ec5bf1a897a1d70b25bae8e1fa0ffd15ffe2061c70f7758c953.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                378,
                583,
                616,
                616
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "这表明，当系统的输入由原激励信号改为其导数时，输出也由原响应函数变成其导数。显然，此结论可扩展至高阶导数与积分。"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                184,
                621,
                810,
                662
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/f00933d02c33c97a23ceb5f07137a20d8259976a7284c4f2fb0d4f6acd4e18e2.jpg"
                },
                "content": "",
                "image_caption": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "微积分特性"
                    }
                ],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
